# Destined Confrontation, total power with a negative power (CR 208.1, 107.1b): the powers add up, and a negative one takes
# away. Bot2 has seven Memnites (power 1 each) and an Ornithopter (power 0). Bot1 casts Destined Confrontation on turn 3
# (Plains, Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire and Black Lotus), and in response Icy Reception gives the Ornithopter -5/-0 - power -5.
# Bot2's seven Memnites and the Ornithopter add up to 2, so Bot2 keeps all eight, though the Memnites alone are power 7: the
# question accepts the Memnites picked before the Ornithopter, the fifth and the rest too. Bot1's two Memnites stay as well.
# Nothing is sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Icy Reception
Memnite
Memnite
Destined Confrontation
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
